Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:37.54,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Precure~！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.44,0:01:41.35,OP＆ED,,0,0,35,,Yes！P·re·cu·re·5！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.54,0:01:45.87,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,长大后想做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:48.08,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想·做·想做·什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:50.92,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,想亲手尝试的事有很多！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.92,0:01:53.09,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,很・多・都・想・做！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:58.09,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,哭鼻子是不能解决问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.29,0:02:02.29,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,用心中的橡皮拭去眼泪吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.05,0:02:07.42,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.85,0:02:07.07,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Metamorphose！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:11.69,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,为梦想而生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.51,0:02:10.88,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.14,0:02:11.54,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Two！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.91,0:02:12.71,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Four！Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.94,0:02:17.07,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,飞翔吧 努力的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.05,0:02:16.37,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Five！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.62,0:02:17.02,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Four！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.42,0:02:18.26,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Three！Two！One！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:22.77,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,未来不是只论成败
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.12,0:02:26.20,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,描绘自己的明天吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:28.08,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.99,0:02:29.45,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,GoGo！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.05,0:02:32.03,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Go Go Go Go！Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.46,0:02:31.00,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,转危为机 坚强地变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.59,0:02:34.97,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.04,0:02:34.80,OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Pretty cu·cu·cu·cure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.31,0:02:37.65,Alternate OP＆ED,,0,0,0,,Yes！
